sequenceDiagram
    participant Panel as Home Panel
    participant Core as Home Core / insights
    participant Cache as Cache mémoire
    participant TD as Twelve Data

    Panel->>Core: GET /v1/insights/markets/{symbol}?period=year
    Core->>Cache: Cherche symbol + période
    alt cache valide
        Cache-->>Core: Points historiques
        Core-->>Panel: history + dataStatus=cached
    else cache absent ou expiré
        Core->>TD: GET /time_series (ticker, 1day, outputsize)
        alt réponse valide
            TD-->>Core: Valeurs datées
            Core->>Cache: Stocke 6 heures
            Core-->>Panel: history + dataStatus=live
        else fournisseur indisponible
            TD-->>Core: Erreur ou réponse vide
            Core-->>Panel: history vide + dataStatus=unavailable
        end
    end
